:: Sculptor_Router {"position":"2500,450","size":"100,100"}
<<set $currentRoute = "sculptor">>

<<if not ($sculptorBuddhaSoundSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound">>
<<elseif not ($sculptorHandShownSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_02_ShowHand">>
<<elseif not ($sculptorCarvingKnifeSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_03_CarvingKnife">>
<<elseif not ($sculptorMidConflictSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_04_HandFire">>
<<elseif (($shura || 0) >= 3 or ($sculptorTouchedFire || false)) and not ($sculptorShuraPreludeSeen || false)>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_05_ShuraPrelude">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_07_FinalChoice">>
<</if>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound {"position":"2500,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $currentRoute = "sculptor">>
<<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 1)>>
<<set $sculptorBuddhaSoundSeen = true>>
<<set $sculptorCarvingSeen = true>>

<div class="narration">
절 안쪽에서 나무를 깎는 소리가 났다.

작고 마른 소리였다.
불도 없는데,
재가 식는 냄새가 났다.

늑대가 문가에 서자,
소리가 멈췄다.
</div>

<<continueTo "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Talk01">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Talk01 {"position":"2625,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
들어왔으면 앉아라.
<</talk>>

<<continueTo "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Talk02">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Talk02 {"position":"2750,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<talk "wolf" "늑대">>
명입니까.
<</talk>>

<<continueTo "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Talk03">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Talk03 {"position":"2875,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
아니다.

그래도 앉아.
<</talk>>

<<continueTo "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Beat01">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Beat01 {"position":"3000,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">
늑대는 앉지 않았다.

조각가는 불상을 다시 깎았다.
칼이 나무를 밀 때마다,
얇은 부스러기가 늑대의 발치까지 흘러왔다.
</div>

<<continueTo "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Choice">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Choice {"position":"3125,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="route-choice-screen">
<div class="choice-box route-choice-box">
<<link "문가에 선다" "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Door_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorConflict = ($sculptorConflict || 0) + 1>>
  <<set $sculptorLove = Math.max(($sculptorLove || 0), (($sculptorAffection || 0) + ($sculptorConflict || 0)))>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "불상 소리를 듣는다" "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Listen_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorAffection = ($sculptorAffection || 0) + 1>>
  <<set $sculptorLove = Math.max(($sculptorLove || 0), (($sculptorAffection || 0) + ($sculptorConflict || 0)))>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "손을 숨긴다" "Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_HideHand_Result">>
  <<set $isolation = ($isolation || 0) + 1>>
  <<set $sculptorHidWound = true>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Door_Result {"position":"3250,525","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">
늑대는 문가에 섰다.

조각가는 고개를 들지 않았다.

나가지도,
들어오지도 못하는 자리를
그는 이미 알고 있는 듯했다.
</div>

<<continueTo "Temple_Return">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_Listen_Result {"position":"3250,575","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">
늑대는 깎는 소리를 들었다.

검이 고기를 가르는 소리와 닮지 않았다.
그런데도 손끝이 먼저 기억했다.
</div>

<<continueTo "Temple_Return">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_BuddhaSound_HideHand_Result {"position":"3250,625","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">
늑대는 손을 소매 안으로 넣었다.

칼 소리가 멈췄다.

조각가는 보지 않고도 말했다.
</div>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
숨긴다고 손이 쉬는 건 아니다.
<</talk>>

<<continueTo "Temple_Return">>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_02_ShowHand {"position":"2500,675","size":"100,100"}
